cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TipsAudit Public Track Record — football predictions, fair odds and closing-line value"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "SIS CONSULTING L.L.C. (TipsAudit)"
    website: "https://tipsaudit.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tipsaudit/track-record-public"
url: "https://tipsaudit.com/track-record"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - sports betting
  - football
  - soccer
  - closing line value
  - bookmaker margin
  - odds
  - forecasting
  - calibration
  - open data
abstract: >-
  Daily, immutable snapshots of every football (soccer) 1X2 prediction published by
  TipsAudit, logged before kick-off with the sharp-market (Pinnacle) opening price,
  the devigged fair probability, the best soft-bookmaker price, the closing price,
  the closing-line value and the settled result. Also includes daily bookmaker-margin
  measurements across ~35 bookmakers and the frozen specifications of pre-registered
  forward experiments. Every snapshot is SHA-256 listed in manifest.csv and anchored in
  the Bitcoin blockchain via OpenTimestamps, so no record can be altered after the fact.
date-released: "2026-06-20"
